#: ../../source/templates_nvidia.md:222
#, python-format
msgid ""
"**Shadow Philosophy**: NVIDIA's depth system is minimal and utilitarian. "
"There is essentially one shadow value -- a 5px ambient blur at 30% "
"opacity -- used sparingly for cards and modals. The primary depth signal "
"is not shadow but _color contrast_: black backgrounds next to white "
"sections, green borders on black surfaces. This creates hardware-like "
"visual layering where depth comes from material difference, not simulated"
" light."
msgstr ""

