#: ../../source/templates_nvidia.md:292
msgid ""
"\"Create a hero section on black background. Headline at 36px NVIDIA-EMEA"
" weight 700, line-height 1.25, color #ffffff. Subtitle at 18px weight "
"400, line-height 1.67, color #a7a7a7. CTA button with transparent "
"background, 2px solid #76b900 border, 2px radius, 11px 13px padding, text"
" #ffffff. Hover: background #1eaedb, text white.\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_nvidia.md:293
msgid ""
"\"Design a product card: white background, 2px border-radius, box-shadow "
"rgba(0,0,0,0.3) 0px 0px 5px. Title at 20px NVIDIA-EMEA weight 700, line-"
"height 1.25, color #000000. Body at 15px weight 400, line-height 1.67, "
"color #757575. Green underline accent on title: border-bottom 2px solid "
"#76b900.\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_nvidia.md:294
msgid ""
"\"Build a navigation bar: #000000 background, sticky top. NVIDIA logo "
"left-aligned. Links at 14px NVIDIA-EMEA weight 700 uppercase, color "
"#ffffff. Hover: color #3860be. Green-bordered CTA button right-aligned.\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_nvidia.md:295
msgid ""
"\"Create a dark feature section: #000000 background. Section label at "
"14px weight 700 uppercase, color #76b900. Heading at 24px weight 700, "
"color #ffffff. Description at 16px weight 400, color #a7a7a7. Three "
"product cards in a row with 20px gap.\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_nvidia.md:296
msgid ""
"\"Design a footer: #000000 background. Multi-column layout with link "
"groups. Links at 14px weight 400, color #a7a7a7. Hover: color #76b900. "
"Bottom bar with legal text at 12px, color #757575.\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_nvidia.md:298
msgid "Iteration Guide"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_nvidia.md:299
msgid ""
"Always use `#76b900` as accent, never as a background fill -- it's a "
"signal color for borders, underlines, and highlights"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_nvidia.md:300
msgid ""
"Buttons are transparent with green borders by default -- filled "
"backgrounds appear only on hover/active states"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_nvidia.md:301
msgid ""
"Weight 700 is the dominant voice for all interactive and heading "
"elements; 400 is only for body paragraphs"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_nvidia.md:302
msgid ""
"Border radius is 2px for everything -- this sharp, minimal rounding is "
"core to the industrial aesthetic"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_nvidia.md:303
msgid ""
"Dark sections use white text; light sections use black text -- green "
"accent works identically on both"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_nvidia.md:304
msgid ""
"Link hover is always `#3860be` (blue) regardless of the link's default "
"color"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_nvidia.md:305
msgid ""
"Line-height 1.25 for headings, 1.50-1.67 for body text -- maintain this "
"contrast for visual hierarchy"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_nvidia.md:306
msgid ""
"Navigation uses uppercase 14px bold -- this hardware-label typography is "
"part of the brand voice"
msgstr ""

